  "tradeOffExplanation": "This is a ROADMAP plan with no deadline, so I booked only the next useful beginner checkpoint: one integrated 90-minute activity that reads your own CSV, groups totals and skips a malformed row. The full eventual expenses report, richer validation and any tooling remain strategic and unbooked until that checkpoint works and you demonstrate it independently. This keeps the first step small and finishable while preserving the full scope for later."
}

